      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the file `query_metric_window.py` that queries recent datapoints for a named metric over a time window, I will use the AWS CloudWatch service as the concrete external provider. AWS CloudWatch is a widely used service for monitoring metrics and logs, and it provides a robust API for querying metrics. I will import the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with CloudWatch. The provider will be identifiable by the import of `boto3` and the use of the `cloudwatch` client. </thinking>\n",
